1
00:00:00,879 --> 00:00:02,649
(Raj:)is only a year away.

2
00:00:02,648 --> 00:00:05,148
(Raj:)A lot of the things in that
movie haven't been invented yet.

3
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:06,350
(Leonard:)How cool would that be

4
00:00:06,351 --> 00:00:07,981
(Leonard:)if we could make
one of those a reality?

5
00:00:07,986 --> 00:00:09,956
(Sheldon:)If we could figure out
the scientific basis

6
00:00:09,955 --> 00:00:11,285
(Sheldon:)for Marty's hover board,

7
00:00:11,289 --> 00:00:13,759
(Sheldon:)that would have
universal application.

8
00:00:13,759 --> 00:00:15,959
Well, it's-it's possible
at absolute zero,

9
00:00:15,961 --> 00:00:17,131
(Leonard:)but we would
have to remove

10
00:00:17,129 --> 00:00:18,829
(Leonard:)the temperature restrictions.

11
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,100
(Raj:)Oh, I have an idea.

12
00:00:20,098 --> 00:00:21,398
(Sheldon:)I think I have the same one.

13
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,370
(Howard:)We got to watch
Back to the Future II!

14
00:00:24,336 --> 00:00:27,406
(Raj:)I'll make the popcorn.

15
00:00:30,008 --> 00:00:31,508
(Penny:)So, where should
we go first?

16
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:32,740
(Raj:)Ooh.

17
00:00:32,744 --> 00:00:34,344
(Amy:)There's a cover band
in the lounge.

18
00:00:34,346 --> 00:00:36,576
(Penny:)Nah.
But they play Barry Manilow.

19
00:00:36,581 --> 00:00:40,221
(Howard:)No.
But they're called
"Fairly Manilow."

20
00:00:41,253 --> 00:00:42,683
(Penny:)Oh. Okay.

21
00:00:42,688 --> 00:00:44,018
Great!
No!

22
00:00:45,157 --> 00:00:47,127
(Bernadette:)Well, what do you want
to do?

23
00:00:47,125 --> 00:00:48,495
(Penny:)Well, we're in Vegas.

24
00:00:48,493 --> 00:00:50,893
(Penny:)I want to go downstairs,
get a bucket of margaritas,

25
00:00:50,896 --> 00:00:53,026
(Penny:)dance until I vomit
all over a roulette wheel

26
00:00:53,031 --> 00:00:54,401
(Penny:)and watch it go everywhere.

27
00:00:55,834 --> 00:00:57,364
(Amy:)What if we don't want to vomit?

28
00:00:57,369 --> 00:01:01,019
(Penny:)Oh, you will. That's why
they give you the bucket.

